*_env.txt
*env_dump*
gs_api_env.txt
CWindowsTemp*
*secret_dump*
*credential_dump*

# ============================================================================

# === OS ===

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

